Package: optLump
Title: Tools for lumping categorical covariates in a way that preserves information
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Daan", "Koning", , "daanolivierkoning@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: OptLump can take a categorical covariate and lump (combine) multiple of the levels together. The way it chooses to do this is by optimizing for the preservation of mutual information between the pre- and post-lumping variables. Support exists for both ordinal, hierarchical, and fully nominal variables.
